---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Fruiting Gardens - MycoLab">
  <div class="page-container">
    <h1 class="page-title">🌱 FRUITING WITH GARDENS</h1>
    
    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Outdoor Cultivation</h2>
      <p>Integrating mushroom cultivation into garden ecosystems for sustainable food production.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Methods</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Log Cultivation:</strong> Shiitake, oyster mushrooms on hardwood logs</li>
        <li><strong>Wood Chip Beds:</strong> Wine cap, garden giant mushrooms</li>
        <li><strong>Totems:</strong> Vertical log stacks for space efficiency</li>
        <li><strong>Hugelkultur:</strong> Incorporating fungi into raised bed systems</li>
        <li><strong>Mycoremediation Beds:</strong> Using fungi to clean contaminated soil</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Companion Planting</h2>
      <p>Symbiotic relationships between mushrooms and garden plants, soil improvement through mycelial networks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Seasonal Considerations</h2>
      <p>Timing inoculations, managing moisture, and harvesting schedules for different climates and species.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
